  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Therefore, the coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant